# Everything configure stages, and everything the compiler produces. The C ABI
# header and library are fetched from the matching GitHub release at install
# time, or taken from WKEX_INC / WKEX_LIB for a local build, so nothing under
# src/ except the glue source and the Makevars templates is committed.
*.o
*.so
*.dll
*.dll.a
*.dylib
symbols.rds
dlltool.log
Makevars
wickra_exchange.h
wickra_exchange.def
wickra-exchange-c.tar.gz
wickra-exchange-c/
